# The standing picture set's PICTURES are the artifact. The renderer's intermediates — the 0.1 mm
# grids (goal.f32/union.f32), the posted programs (.nc), the SVGs the PNGs were rasterised from
# and grid.json — are reproducible by `scripts/card-renders.mts` and stay out of the tree: they
# are tens of MB per sha against ~0.5 MB of pictures per card.
*.f32
*.nc
*.svg
grid.json
